# Meseta Cumbre (C9, contract 56), 22 x 18. column = i, row = j. The Senda's exit arrives at the SOUTH edge (10..11, 17); the League hall (door (10,3)) stands at the north; the Planeador lands in front of the door (slot 10).
# Look: the user's approved MESETA scene (tools/c9_mock.py): a big light MARBLE plaza (2 x 2 slabs with a soft vein), the winged-crown statue in the middle, league banners and harbour-style lamps, stone walls at the back and pickets at the front.
@map meseta_cumbre
@size 22 18
@interior no
@area meseta_cumbre
@fly 10 meseta_cumbre 10 4 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the hall's door; slot 10 = visited flag 994 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fill marb_00
@spawn south 10 16 N
@spawn lobby_door 10 4 S
@spawn ruins_door 4 2 S      # D1 (contract 68): the way out of the Ruinas del Origen (in front of the sealed slab's passage)
@legend
  0  tile=marb_00 object=pillar
  1  tile=marb_10 object=stonewall_j
  2  tile=marb_00 object=stonewall_j
  3  tile=marb_10 object=pillar
  4  tile=marb_01 object=stonewall_i
  5  tile=marb_11 
  6  tile=marb_01 
